SUMMARY:Instagram: Reel: Guess the pay\, optician\, Ontario
DESCRIPTION:Platform: Instagram\nType: Reel. Show in profile grid: OFF\nFi
 le: design/social-and-merch/instagram-guides/guess-the-pay-1.mp4 · cover
  design/social-and-merch/instagram-guides/guess-the-pay-1-cover.jpg (Edit
  cover\, Add from camera roll)\nLocation: Canada\nReply to guesses in the
  comments.\n\nCAPTION:\nGuess the pay: optician\, Ontario.\n\nA\, B or C?
  Comment your guess before you watch to the end.\n\nThe typical (median) 
 pay for an optician in Ontario is $29.00 an hour\, and half earn between 
 $23.44 and $35.43. Commission\, an eyewear allowance and benefits matter 
 too\, so compare the whole offer.\n\nOn Kestrel Eye Care Jobs\, you'll ne
 ver have to guess: every job shows its pay. Pre launch is open. Create yo
 ur account: link in bio.\n\nSource: Job Bank wages\, Employment and Socia
 l Development Canada (Labour Force Survey 2024 to 2025). Contains informa
 tion licensed under the Open Government Licence – Canada.\n\n#Opticians
  #OpticianPay #EyeCareJobs #OntarioJobs #PayTransparency\n\nALT TEXT:\nA 
 short quiz animation. Text reads: Guess the pay. Optician\, Ontario. A\, 
 $22 an hour. B\, $29 an hour. C\, $36 an hour. Comment A\, B or C. After 
 a 5 second countdown\, B is revealed: typical (median) pay $29.00 an hour
 . Half of opticians in Ontario earn between $23.44 and $35.43 an hour. Th
 en: On Kestrel\, you'll never have to guess. Every job shows its pay.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Post now: Instagram\, Reel: Guess the pay\, optician\, Ontario
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
