SUMMARY:Instagram: Reel: Job ad phrases\, translated
DESCRIPTION:Platform: Instagram\nType: Reel. Show in profile grid: OFF\nFi
 le: design/social-and-merch/instagram-guides/phrases-reel.mp4 · cover de
 sign/social-and-merch/instagram-guides/phrases-reel-cover.jpg (Edit cover
 \, Add from camera roll)\nLocation: Canada\n\nCAPTION:\nJob ads have thei
 r own language. Here's the translation.\n\n"Competitive salary": we'd rat
 her not say yet. Ask for the pay range.\n"Fast paced environment": it's b
 usy. Ask how many patients a day.\n"We're like a family": lovely\, but ho
 urs matter too. Ask about evenings and Saturdays.\n"Wear many hats": you 
 might do a bit of everything. Ask what a typical day looks like.\n"Must b
 e flexible": the schedule may change. Ask how far ahead it's set.\n\nOn K
 estrel Eye Care Jobs\, you won't need to ask the first one: every job sho
 ws its pay. Which phrase have you seen most?\n\nPre launch is open. Creat
 e your account: link in bio.\n\n#EyeCareJobs #JobSearch #Opticians #Optom
 etricAssistant #CanadaJobs\n\nALT TEXT:\nA short animation. Text reads: J
 ob ads have their own language. Here's the translation. 5 phrases are cir
 cled by a chestnut feather\, each with a translation and a question to as
 k: Competitive salary\, we'd rather not say yet. Fast paced environment\,
  it's busy. We're like a family\, lovely but hours matter too. Wear many 
 hats\, you might do a bit of everything. Must be flexible\, the schedule 
 may change. Ends with: On Kestrel\, you won't need to ask the first one. 
 Every job shows its pay.
